### Create once
POST http://localhost:8000/caesura/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Python example"}

> {%
  client.assert(response.status === 201, "Creation failed");
  client.global.set("conversationId", response.body.id);
%}

### First customer turn
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{"conversationId":"{{conversationId}}","input":[{"role":"user","content":"Can you help me prepare for a meeting?"}]}

### Continue the same conversation using Chat Completions
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId":"{{conversationId}}",
  "messages":[
    {"role":"user","content":"Can you help me prepare for a meeting?"},
    {"role":"assistant","content":"What is the meeting about?"},
    {"role":"user","content":"Planning our next release."}
  ],
  "stream":true
}

### Fetch saved customer analyses (not a full transcript archive)
GET http://localhost:8000/caesura/conversations/{{conversationId}}
